abstract: >-
  tWhEEL is a Docker-oriented pipeline for transcriptome-based protein
  prediction, similarity-based annotation, SpCas9 guide design, and
  function-level knockout feasibility assessment using Gene Ontology and
  an SGD-centered pathway workflow. KFI describes guide-design feasibility;
  it does not measure experimental editing efficiency or establish loss of
  biological function. Version 1.3.5 corrects GO-KFI report counts and chart
  geometry without changing GO-KFI calculation or guide selection.
